NAME TSHELL
DESCRIPTION 'Tandy Start Shell - Windows 3.0 / 8086'
EXETYPE WINDOWS
CODE PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE
HEAPSIZE 2048
STACKSIZE 4096
EXPORTS
 WndProc @1
 ExitProc @2
 RunProc @3
 BrowseProc @4
 PmDialogProc @5
 NoticeProc @6
 DateProc @7
 SaverCfgProc @8
 StarOptProc @9
